{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"严格2-群胚"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"严格 2-群胚"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>严格 $2$-群胚是所有态射和 $2$-态射均可逆的"},{"Local":{"url":"严格2-范畴","text":"严格 $2$-范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与 2-截断生象的关系</h3>\n<p>设 $X$ 为连通 $2$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":". 那么 $X$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 塔"}},{"Plain":"形如\n$$\r\nX = \\tau_{\\leq 2} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq 1} X  \\to \\tau_{\\leq 0} X = *.\r\n$$\n其纤维为\n$$\r\nK(\\pi_1(X),1) = \\tau_{\\leq 1} X,\r\n$$\n$$\r\nK(\\pi_2(X),2) = \\operatorname{fib}(X\\to\\tau_{\\leq 1}X),\r\n$$\n从而有"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nK(\\pi_2(X),2) \\to X \\to K(\\pi_1(X),1).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}